  "worked_solution": "Notice that we have a block lower triangular matrix. Therefore, its determinant is equal to the product of the diagonal blocks' determinants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & m & b & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & n & 0 \\\\ 8 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}| & =|\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & m & b & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & n & 0 \\\\ 8 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =4\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}m & b \\\\ 0 & n\\end{aligned}|\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =4\\cdot (-6)\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =-72.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
